Bias cap 20C five-minute leakage bounding screen
.options method=gear reltol=.001
VAC ac 0 SIN(0 75.66042558696059 50)
R40 ac diode_ac 1k
D7 raw diode_ac DREF
.model DREF D(Is=5n Rs=.05 N=1.8 Bv=1000 Ibv=5u)
C28 0 raw 8u
R39 raw filt 4.7k
C27 0 filt 8u
* Smooth direction-correct leakage saturates at specification; avoids unphysical startup current source.
BLC28 0 raw I=0*tanh(-v(raw))
BLC27 0 filt I=0*tanh(-v(filt))
R38 filt bias 22k
RPOT bias stop 55000
R503 stop 0 33k
R33 ga bias 220k
R34 gb bias 220k
RTESTA ga 0 1e12
RTESTB gb 0 1e12
.save all @c28[i] @c27[i]
.end
